6. No warranty
   The Studio is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. You use it at your own
   risk. Check every curriculum you make before you use it with children. To the extent
   the law allows, the copyright holder is not liable for any damage that comes from using
   the Studio.

7. Contact
   To ask for a permission that this licence does not give, open an issue in this
   repository.
